{
 "_about": "Step 3: API-misuse catalogue as DATA (crypto, JWT, cookies, headers, TLS, CSRF, debug). No application names. Call specs match on resolved method name (mfn) or name+receiver; 'arg'+'bad' check the argument after constant resolution (literal, static final field, enum-free); 'absent' = the same method must NOT contain a call matching it; 'tokens' = identifiers/field names/literals that name a weak primitive inside a method that also does hashing/crypto. Methods hit directly are tagged; their callers (depth 3) inherit the tag.",
